{"4383440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Not Yet", "steam_appid": 4383440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4741240], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOT YET is a first-person psychological horror experience about pressure, silence, and the moment you realize turning back was never an option.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at a quiet hotel believing there is something left unfinished.<br>You’re not sure what, only that leaving feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ae7b9bc032cbbf4deae668e8a0d9b292.poster.avif?t=1782982794\" width=654 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ae7b9bc032cbbf4deae668e8a0d9b292.webm?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ae7b9bc032cbbf4deae668e8a0d9b292.mp4?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything feels ordinary.<br>Clean hallways. Polite faces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as you descend floor by floor, the space begins to shift, subtly at first, and so does your sense of why you’re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs never move. <br>They never intervene. <br>They never explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/75dcbee24e577ed5242da51d0f74d934.poster.avif?t=1782982794\" width=654 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/75dcbee24e577ed5242da51d0f74d934.webm?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/75dcbee24e577ed5242da51d0f74d934.mp4?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They simply exist, like reminders you didn’t ask for, and can’t escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character never speaks.<br>The game never tells you why.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCENT, NOT PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the four floors represents a deeper descent, not toward answers, but away from certainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lower you go, the emptier the world feels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you’re searching for seems closer, yet harder to define.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FOCUSED, SINGLE-SITTING EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric psychological horror driven by sound and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person, fully linear narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~45-minute short narrative experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct floors with evolving ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS1-style low-poly visuals with handcrafted models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no traditional puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones strongly recommended</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ab68b11aecb0d559e0b07fd80ef4dd2e.poster.avif?t=1782982794\" width=654 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ab68b11aecb0d559e0b07fd80ef4dd2e.webm?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ab68b11aecb0d559e0b07fd80ef4dd2e.mp4?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the bottom, something finally feels different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not sure what changed.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOT YET is a first-person psychological horror experience about pressure, silence, and the moment you realize turning back was never an option.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at a quiet hotel believing there is something left unfinished.<br>You’re not sure what, only that leaving feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ae7b9bc032cbbf4deae668e8a0d9b292.poster.avif?t=1782982794\" width=654 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ae7b9bc032cbbf4deae668e8a0d9b292.webm?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ae7b9bc032cbbf4deae668e8a0d9b292.mp4?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything feels ordinary.<br>Clean hallways. Polite faces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as you descend floor by floor, the space begins to shift, subtly at first, and so does your sense of why you’re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs never move. <br>They never intervene. <br>They never explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/75dcbee24e577ed5242da51d0f74d934.poster.avif?t=1782982794\" width=654 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/75dcbee24e577ed5242da51d0f74d934.webm?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/75dcbee24e577ed5242da51d0f74d934.mp4?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They simply exist, like reminders you didn’t ask for, and can’t escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character never speaks.<br>The game never tells you why.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCENT, NOT PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the four floors represents a deeper descent, not toward answers, but away from certainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lower you go, the emptier the world feels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you’re searching for seems closer, yet harder to define.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FOCUSED, SINGLE-SITTING EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric psychological horror driven by sound and environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person, fully linear narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~45-minute short narrative experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct floors with evolving ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS1-style low-poly visuals with handcrafted models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no traditional puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones strongly recommended</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ab68b11aecb0d559e0b07fd80ef4dd2e.poster.avif?t=1782982794\" width=654 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ab68b11aecb0d559e0b07fd80ef4dd2e.webm?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/extras/ab68b11aecb0d559e0b07fd80ef4dd2e.mp4?t=1782982794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the bottom, something finally feels different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not sure what changed.</p>", "short_description": "NOT YET is a first-person psychological horror experience where silence grows heavier the deeper you go, and hesitation becomes its own consequence.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/b199dcf67f8d977bd9f8fef22f8635f21dac6df7/header.jpg?t=1782982794", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/a99f5dceed0faaf224197226c8ad70fed8011a25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782982794", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4383440/a99f5dceed0faaf224197226c8ad70fed8011a25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782982794", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 (6th generation) / AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / NVIDIA GTX 650 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game uses a 427×240 internal resolution. Headphones recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<str